fired = open items the last sweep classified via that selector (current snapshot, not lifetime history).
dismissed = /ostrom:desk rejections of a row that selector produced, recorded in selector-events.jsonl.
path: only applies to PRs (sweep.sh gates it on $item.type == "pr"); for issues every prefix above is author-written and there is no content-derived gating at all.

Dismissals attributed to no selector (the project default fired instead): 1
These are not a selector's false alarms and are kept out of the table above.

